{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Coming.</b> For from the direction of Elam they came, as though they are from the edge of the heavens — a hint to [them coming] from afar." "<b>YHWH.</b> And behold, the decrees of HaShem have come, and 'the weapons of His wrath' — they are Persia and Media."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:32.633129227Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}